cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CRSV in the Security Council, 2000-2025"
abstract: >-
  A dataset and interactive instrument covering 72 United Nations Security Council
  resolutions bearing on conflict-related sexual violence, 2000-2025, coded by
  category, situation and thematic emphasis, with the operative and preambular
  paragraphs that carry the language. Version 2026.09 codes every qualifying paragraph
  (409 rows) and records the force of each provision, its provenance and any earlier
  paragraph whose wording it reproduces.
message: "If you use this dataset or instrument, please cite it."
type: dataset
version: "2026.09"
authors:
  - family-names: Chikuhwa
    given-names: Tonderai
    affiliation: >-
      UN Office of the Special Representative of the Secretary-General on Sexual
      Violence in Conflict; Macalester College
    role: Project lead and conceptual framework
  - family-names: He
    given-names: Zhijun
    affiliation: >-
      MacMillan Center, Yale University; UN Office of the Special Representative of the
      Secretary-General on Sexual Violence in Conflict
    email: zhijun.he@yale.edu
    role: Lead developer
keywords:
  - conflict-related sexual violence
  - United Nations Security Council
  - women peace and security
  - sanctions designation criteria
